# Output directory for `pnpm profile` (tools/profile-tracks.mjs).
#
# Each run writes a timestamped `perf-<ISO>.md` desktop perf table here. Those
# generated reports are run artifacts — like the qa-report/ convention, they're
# not meant to be committed (consider adding `perf-report/perf-*.md` to
# .gitignore). This .gitkeep just keeps the destination present in a fresh
# clone so the script's first run has somewhere obvious to land.
